<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN2/Tdoc/tdoc:R2-2509206> spectra:sourceAuthoredSummary "Stating that in IOT NTN TDD mode, UE may need to perform the measurements during the Guard Periods (Guard Periods are invalid UL and DL periods)." .
