<https://w3id.org/spectra/inst/RAN2/Tdoc/tdoc:R2-2509221> spectra:sourceAuthoredSummary "General description on bandwidth aggregation, frequency hopping and carrier phase positioning have been added for each impacted positioning method in TS 38.305.\n\nImpacted functionality:\nBW Aggregation, Frequency Hopping, Carrier Phase,\nInter-operability:\nNo Inter-Operability issue foreseen between UE and NW." .
